{"seq":5,"slug":"flavor-science","title":"风味学","stage":"DONE","category":"cooking-food-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science","rating":{"composite":3.89,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 风味学\n\n风味学（Flavor Science）是一门研究食物风味感知、形成机理、设计方法与分析技术的交叉学科。它融合了感官生理学、有机化学、食品科学与认知心理学等多个领域的知识，旨在揭示人类如何感知和评价食物的味道与气味，以及如何利用这些规律来设计更优质的食品风味。\n\n## 学科定位\n\n风味是人类进食体验的核心维度。从分子层面看，风味由味觉（taste）和嗅觉（aroma）两大通道共同构成，辅以口感（mouthfeel）、温度感（thermosensation）和化学刺激感（chemesthesis）等多模态信息的整合。风味学正是围绕这一复杂感知系统展开系统研究的学科。\n\n在现代食品工业中，风味学的应用价值不断攀升。从传统调味品开发到精准营养配方设计，从植物基蛋白的异味消除到 AI 辅助的新风味探索，风味学为食品创新提供了坚实的科学基础。\n\n## 知识体系\n\n本知识库围绕风味学的四个核心维度展开：\n\n**味觉感知**：从味觉受体的分子生物学机制出发，深入探讨五种基本味觉及鲜味（umami）、浓厚味（kokumi）等复合味觉的产生原理，以及味觉之间的交互作用与掩蔽效应。理解味觉感知是风味设计的第一步。\n\n**香气化学**：挥发性化合物是香气的物质基础。本模块系统梳理挥发性化合物的分类体系，重点剖析美拉德反应（Maillard Reaction）在香气生成中的核心作用，以及食品中异味的成因分析与控制策略。\n\n**风味配对与设计**：从食物配对假说（Food Pairing Hypothesis）到风味平衡构建原则，再到调味科学的实践方法论，本模块将分子层面的知识转化为可操作的风味设计框架。\n\n**风味测量技术**：涵盖传统感官评价方法、气相色谱-质谱联用（GC-MS）与电子鼻等仪器分析手段，以及前沿的 AI 风味预测技术，构建从主观评价到客观量化的完整测量体系。\n\n## 学习路径\n\n建议按章节顺序学习：先建立味觉感知的生物学基础，再深入香气化学的分子机制，然后学习如何将这些知识应用于风味设计实践，最后掌握风味测量与评价的方法论。每个模块既可独立阅读，也构成递进的知识链条。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"taste-perception","title":"味觉感知","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/taste-perception","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"taste-receptor-biology","title":"味觉受体生物学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/taste-perception/taste-receptor-biology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"umami-kokumi-science","title":"鲜味与浓厚味科学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/taste-perception/umami-kokumi-science"},{"seq":3,"slug":"taste-interaction-masking","title":"味觉交互与掩蔽效应","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/taste-perception/taste-interaction-masking"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"aroma-chemistry","title":"香气化学","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/aroma-chemistry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"volatile-compound-classes","title":"挥发性化合物分类","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/aroma-chemistry/volatile-compound-classes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"maillard-aroma-generation","title":"美拉德反应香气生成","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/aroma-chemistry/maillard-aroma-generation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"off-flavor-analysis","title":"异味分析与控制","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/aroma-chemistry/off-flavor-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"flavor-pairing-design","title":"风味配对与设计","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-pairing-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"food-pairing-theory","title":"食物配对理论","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-pairing-design/food-pairing-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"flavor-balance-construction","title":"风味平衡构建","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-pairing-design/flavor-balance-construction"},{"seq":3,"slug":"seasoning-science","title":"调味科学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-pairing-design/seasoning-science"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"flavor-measurement-technology","title":"风味测量技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sensory-evaluation-methods","title":"感官评价方法","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology/sensory-evaluation-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"gc-ms-electronic-nose","title":"GC-MS 与电子鼻","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology/gc-ms-electronic-nose"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-flavor-prediction","title":"AI 风味预测","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/flavor-science/flavor-measurement-technology/ai-flavor-prediction"}]}]}